<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.6">
<l>uṉṉuṭaiya vikkirama moṉṟoḻi yāmalellām</l>
<l>eṉṉuṭaiya neñcakampāl cuvarvaḻi yeḻutikoṇṭēṉ</l>
<l>maṉṉaṭaṅka maḻuvalaṅkaik koṇṭavi rāmanampī</l>
<l>eṉṉiṭaivan temperumā ṉiṉiyeṅkup pōkiṉṟatē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>I have taken and inscribed the impressions</l>
<l rend="indent">of all your heroic deeds without omitting one</l>
<l>on the walls inside my heart.</l>
<l>Noble Rāma who bears [his] axe</l>
<l rend="indent">on [his] right side such that it subdues kings!</l>
<l>Our Lord, having come to me,</l>
<l rend="indent">now where is there to go?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
